pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: |-
  研究背景：规模与数据都不缺，缺的是逐样本刻画驾驶行为的连续特征。
  已知：2022 年新能源汽车销量 688.7 万辆、电动汽车占 78.9%；现有预测多只看 SOC 与平均能耗。
  缺口：聚类标签让同簇样本共享单一标签，无法刻画每个样本点对能耗的影响。
elements:
  - elementId: chapter-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 960, 56]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primary" }
  - elementId: chapter-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 11, 640, 34]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 24
      color: "#FFFFFF"
      bold: true
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: '01. 研究背景 —— 续航焦虑与预测偏差'
  - elementId: chapter-brand
    elementType: text
    bounds: [736, 20, 176, 16]
    content:
      fontFamily: "LXGW Neo XiHei"
      fontSize: 8.8
      color: "$accent6"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: EV RANGE · 学术报告
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 70, 864, 34]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      wrap: false
      text: 预测偏差来自被忽略的驾驶行为差异
  - elementId: subtitle
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 104, 864, 16]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      fontSize: 9.6
      wrap: false
      text: 规模与数据都不缺，缺的是把驾驶行为逐样本量化的特征
  - elementId: known-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 132, 414, 196]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [9000]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line" }
    shadow: { blur: 10, color: "#1F5FBF14", offset: [0, 2] }
  - elementId: known-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [68, 148, 374, 16]
    content:
      style: "$label"
      fontSize: 8.6
      letterSpacing: 1.6
      wrap: false
      text: 已知 / WHAT IS KNOWN
  - elementId: known-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [68, 172, 374, 142]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 10.6
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |-
        <p>· 2022 年我国新能源汽车销量 688.7 万辆，其中电动汽车占 78.9%。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:5px">· 现有车型多仅以 SOC、平均能耗等因素估算剩余续驶里程，预测结果与实际偏差较大。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:5px">· 聚类方法让同一簇内所有样本共享单一标签，难以刻画每个样本点对能耗的影响。</p>
  - elementId: gap-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [486, 132, 426, 196]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [9000]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "$primarySoft" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$primaryTint" }
    shadow: { blur: 12, color: "#1F5FBF1A", offset: [0, 3] }
  - elementId: gap-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [506, 148, 386, 16]
    content:
      style: "$label"
      fontSize: 8.6
      letterSpacing: 1.6
      wrap: false
      text: 缺口 / THE GAP
  - elementId: gap-statement
    elementType: text
    bounds: [506, 170, 386, 42]
    content:
      fontFamily: "Source Han Serif CN"
      fontSize: 14.5
      color: "$primaryDeep"
      bold: true
      lineHeight: 1.45
      text: 没有一个连续的、可赋权的单样本驾驶行为特征。
  - elementId: gap-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [506, 218, 386, 76]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 10.4
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |-
        <p>驾驶行为对能耗的影响因此被平均化：同一 SOC 下，激进驾驶与温和驾驶的剩余里程差异无法进入预测。</p>
  - elementId: gap-consequence
    elementType: text
    bounds: [506, 300, 386, 18]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      fontSize: 8.8
      wrap: false
      text: 后果：续航焦虑与充电规划失准。
  - elementId: stat-1-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 344, 272, 118]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [9000]
    fill: { type: solid, color: "#FFFFFF" }
    border: { style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line" }
    shadow: { blur: 10, color: "#1F5FBF14", offset: [0, 2] }
  - elementId: stat-1-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [68, 358, 232, 36]
    content:
      style: "$stat"
      wrap: false
      text: |-
        <p><span style="font-size:26px;">688.7</span><span style="font-size:12px;color:$muted;"> 万辆</span></p>
  - elementId: stat-1-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [68, 400, 232, 34]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      fontSize: 9
      text: 2022 年我国新能源汽车销量
  - elementId: stat-2-card
